@startuml
skinparam HeaderFontSize 20
skinparam FooterFontSize 15
header
Component diagram describing the detailed scope of task F1T003
(data transformation) – FILE mode
endheader
footer Author: kalinpi
allowmixing
skinparam linetype polyline

component Robot [
@task prep
====

====
<<list>> race_sheets
]

folder "testcifs/in" {
  file RIN <<*RACES*.xlsx>> [
  | Sheet "{year} {location}"\column: | race result (from F1T001 / F1T002) |
  | A | Pos |
  | B | No |
  | C | Driver |
  | D | Team |
  | E | Gap to leader / DNF / DNS / DSQ |
  | F | Tyres (e.g. MH) |
  | G | Laps per stint |
  ]
}

folder "testcifs/out" {
  file ROUT <<*RACES*.xlsx>> [
  | Sheet "Statistics"\column: | RACES_out |
  | A | <#00AA00>Race <-- computed |
  | B | <#00AA00>Winner <-- computed |
  | C | <#00AA00>Winner team <-- computed |
  | D | <#00AA00>Classified <-- computed |
  | E | <#00AA00>DNF/DNS/DSQ <-- computed |
  | F | <#00AA00>Avg pit stops <-- computed |
  | G | <#00AA00>Most common tyre strategy <-- computed |
  | H | <#00AA00>status: OK / error_description <-- if error |
  ====
  | Summary | <#00AA00>number of races, strategy, pit stops, DNF, best team (points), most wins |
  ]
}

Robot -d-> "testcifs/in" : 1. \nLoad race\nresult sheets
Robot -r-> ROUT          : 2a. \nMove with\nexecution date
Robot .r.> ROUT          : 2b. \nMove with\nerror as\nERROR_RACES.xlsx

legend bottom left
  |= Color / Icon |= Meaning |
  |testcifs| Network folder available by RPA and user |
  | →   | Invokes process flow |
  | - ->| Conditional flow (in case of error)  |
endlegend
@enduml
